{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Every claim of ONE memory domain (lib.ctl) as recall would see it: the control's shipped memory facet (legacy array or line-oriented JSON) with the instance-local overlay (runtime/agent/memory-overlay/<lib>.<ctl>.jsonl) applied, latest line per claim winning. No query and no cap - the listing agent.archivist.recall cannot give. Read-only. Returns {status, home, facet_exists, shipped (claims in the facet), overlay_lines, count (claims not superseded), stale, claims:[{claim, detail, tags, confidence, author, subject, time, age_days, origin (shipped | overlay = overlay only | both = an overlay line supersedes the shipped entry), promoted, superseded, stale, stale_checked, source}]} in stored order, or {status err, msg} for an unknown control. kb.plan is not special-cased: it answers the legacy facet, not the plan board.","import":"use ndata::dataobject::DataObject;\nuse ndata::dataarray::DataArray;\nuse flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse flowlang::flowlang::system::time::time;","params":[{"name":"lib","type":"String"},{"name":"ctl","type":"String"}],"returntype":"JSONObject","type":"rust"},"id":"qxtkkr1a1e0aaadc6t5","readers":[],"time":1794770665473,"username":"system","writers":[]}